From 7509c6ba4e308d652c681dca176a00aa94ab9cbe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Wong <ewong@anl.gov>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:36:54 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [NFC] Migrate the Intel backend off deprecated op
